Contributing
============

Development requires Rust, Docker, Bun 1.3.14, and PostgreSQL. Run the local
database with `just services`, install frontend dependencies with
`bun install --cwd www`, and use `just all` for the standard backend and
frontend checks.

The OpenAPI contract and TypeScript client are generated files. Do not edit
`openapi/jobs-surf.json` or `www/src/client/` manually. Run
`just www-generate` after changing an HTTP handler or schema, and commit the
result with the related API change.

Keep provider DTOs inside their adapter and keep raw provider payloads out of
the public API. Provider tests must use committed fixtures or local HTTP
servers, never live career pages.

Unless you explicitly state otherwise, any contribution intentionally
submitted for inclusion in the work by you shall be licensed as in
LICENSE, without any additional terms or conditions.
